      <groundspeak:encoded_hints>1CM BGL 30 M S ROOF C00K SHACK

ASC CAP 1.0 CM BGL.27.9 M S OF THE S EDGE OF ROOF OF COOK SHACK LOOKING E; 17.83 M N OF CONCRETE RETAINING 
