          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP337 Hawrelak Park South&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My first brass cap find of the day, showed ScottDWK what all the hype was about! 

Huge thanks to WillowZilla who's photos helped us out!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
